        "original_id": "b885a216-d1da-5489-bb3b-a6d18a7a7a82",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Xingcheng, Linzhou, Henan, Liaoning province, Liaodong Bay, Bohai Sea, Huludao, China\n- Organizations: Liaoning Finance and Trade College, Shenyang Shifan University Bohai College\n- People: Wan Da\n\nFacts:\n- Xingcheng, formerly named Ningyuan, is a county-level city in southwest Liaoning province, China.\n- Xingcheng is located on Liaodong Bay on the northern coast of the Bohai Sea and has about 140,000 urban inhabitants.\n- Linzhou, Henan covers 2,046 square kilometers and has a population of about one million.\n- Liaoning Finance and Trade College was formerly known as Shenyang Shifan University Bohai College.\n- Liaoning Finance and Trade College is a small private undergraduate college in Xingcheng, southwest of Huludao in Liaoning province, on Liaodong Bay along the Bohai coast of China.\n- Wan Da was born in Linzhou, Henan.",
